\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  View: S. Korea Rescue Plan Seen Helping Yen \b0\par\par\uc2  By Kenji Hall \par \uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Dezember 1997\par 00:00\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--International efforts to rescue South Korea may bring some cheer to yen buyers' New Year celebrations this week. \par \par \uc2  The plan to speed disbursements of the record $57 billion in IMF-orchestrated aid to Korea is seen alleviating some of the pressure that plummeting South Korean markets have exerted on the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . While the measures are unlikely to derail the dollar;'s steady ascent against the yen, they could stall the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's bull run. \par \par \uc2  But with global markets closed Thursday for New Year's Day and most \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading finished for 1997, few traders expect any dramatic moves in the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Late Friday, the dollar was quoted at 130.39 yen, up from 129.86 yen late Wednesday. It was also quoted at 1.7735 marks, up from 1.7722 marks late Wednesday. Sterling was trading at $1.6788, up about one cent from $1.6690. \par \par \uc2  Despite expectations for a dull week, economists aren't ruling out the possibility that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. Last week, the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  failed to give substance to rumors that it would take advantage of the illiquid trading environment on Christmas Day and sell dollars to buttress the yen. Concerns remain, however, that a BOJ move could topple the dollar, even though analysts see little change in the economic fundamentals stacked against the Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The yen has been pressured in recent weeks by economic turbulence at home and in neighboring South Korea. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 28-12-97 \par \par \uc2  2300GMT \par \par \uc2  1141 4137 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtcs09x1t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
