\par\par \b \uc2  Tokyo Midday:  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Curbs Dlr; Upside Seen Retested \b0\par\par\uc2 335 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 Dezember 1997\par 03:44\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (AP-Dow Jones)--The U.S. dollar is lower against the yen at midday in Tokyo Friday compared with its levels early in the session, after apparent \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  and verbal warnings by Japanese and U.S. officials briefly capped its upward push. \par \par \uc2  Fear that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again Friday is likely to cap the dollar around the Y130.00 level for the next few hours, traders said. \par \par \uc2  'I wouldn't be surprised if the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  again at any time,' a trader at a Japanese city bank said. \par \par \uc2  Many traders said the Bank of Japan apparently sold dollars for yen at Y129.30-Y129.50, marking the third straight day of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , although this couldn't be confirmed. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's vice finance minister Eisuke Sakakibara and finance minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka warned that Japan would take steps against excessive yen weakness. U.S. Treasury Secretary Robert Rubin endorsed Bank of Japan efforts to bolster the yen, calling the support effort 'appropriate'. \par \par \uc2  Nevertheless, the dollar remains fundamentally strong and is likely to continue testing higher against the yen, many market participants said. They said Y130.00 could well be broken in European trading later Friday. \par \par \uc2  'Dollar buying pressure is very strong,' said a trader at a French bank in Tokyo. Medium-term players are buying dollars between Y128.00-Y129.00, the trader added. \par \par \uc2  Around 0210 GMT (8:10 p.m. EST), the dollar is trading at Y128.90, down from Y129.05 around 0005 GMT (7:05 p.m. EST) but above Y128.73 in New York late Thursday. The dollar was quoted at Y127.30 in Tokyo late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also trading at DM1.7742, lower than DM1.7745 earlier in Tokyo and below DM1.7745 late Thursday in New York. The dollar was at DM1.7739 in Tokyo late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-12-97 \par \par \uc2  0244GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 1863 4162 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtcj09tni\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
