\par\par \b \uc2  Japan Debt Ends -2:Muted Impact From 3rd Econ Plan Release \b0\par\par\uc2 337 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Dezember 1997\par 08:42\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    The rate cut speculation came amid expectation that the\par Y2-trillion tax cut, to be financed by deficit bonds, would\par push long-term market interest rates higher and prompt the\par government to ease monetary policy to offset that.\par    But market players said such long market rates won't\par likely rise as the extra issues would be absorbed easily.\par    The Bank of Japan continued to take a generous stance\par Thursday via its money market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , leaving Y500\par billion of reserves above the requirement for the second\par straight session. The Y500 billion is much less than the\par amount that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has left in recent sessions -\par another source of the easing speculation, traders said.\par    Some participants thought the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reduced the\par reserves to push the overnight rate higher to around 0.50% -\par to give room for a cut as call rates are currently well below\par 0.50%, traders said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  But others said as the Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market for two consecutive\par sessions to boost the yen, they may have felt compelled to\par keep rates slightly higher.\par    "The speculation is nothing more than this," said the\par manager. "The market didn't pay serious attention to it."\par    The key unsecured rate for overnight call money fell 10\par basis points to 0.25% Thursday from late Wednesday.\par    The ruling Liberal Democratic Party officially approved\par its third proposal on economic stimulus steps Thursday, but\par it had muted impact on the market as these measures simply\par confirmed what has already been reported, traders said.\par    On the supply side, Fuji Electric Co. offered a total of\par Y40 billion of bonds in two tranches. DKB Securities Co. lead\par managed Y20 billion of 2.15% five-year bonds issued at\par 100.00, or par. IBJ Securities Co. lead managed the Y20\par billion of 2.35% six-year bonds at par.\par    - Michiyo Seki, 813-5255-2941, mseki@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) DOW JONES NEWS  12-18-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0242EST\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  4077 4153 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020011006dtci02ptk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
