\par\par \b \uc2  BOJ  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  talk knocks dollar down in Tokyo. \b0\par\par\uc2 526 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 November 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par \tab \tab  0300 GMT\tab      TRADED HIGH/LOW AS OF 0300 GMT\par  USD/JPY     125.52/55\tab \tab    126.65-125.20\par  USD/DEM     1.7215/20\tab \tab    1.7260-1.7145\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ---------------------------------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Nov 13 (Reuters) - Talk of Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) dollar-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  knocked the dollar lower against the yen early on Thursday, but it recovered from its lows by midday on bargain-hunting and doubts about such \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  A media report earlier said that the BOJ appeared to have sold dollars for yen in morning trade in Singapore. A senior Finance Ministry official declined to comment on the report. \par \par \uc2  "Although we could not confirm it, we doubt that such action really took place," said a bank trader. "Profit-taking by overseas operators triggered stop-loss sales at 125.50 yen and knocked the dollar down to 125.20 yen," he added. \par \par \uc2  Caution about dollar selling against the yen by the BOJ had been building since the beginning of trade here, partly due to a newspaper report that the Finance Ministry and the Bank of Japan were waiting for a good time to sell dollars for yen. \par \par \uc2  The Mainichi Shimbun said on Thursday that MOF and the BOJ have been considering dollar sales \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  since last week. \par \par \uc2  But it said they have been unable to find right time to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market due to falling stocks and poor economic conditions. \par \par \uc2  "There were rumours the BOJ was in the market. That's what brought dollar/yen sharply lower. They are very worried about the dollar/yen being around 128/130," said a dealer at a European bank in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  Many Tokyo dealers are betting that the BOJ will not be able to sell dollars for yen aggressively because such action would be out of line with economic fundamentals and could risk hurting the stock market. \par \par \uc2  Earlier on Thursday, Finance Minister Hiroshi Mitsuzuka said that Hong Kong's G7 agreement on \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  was still intact, adding that Japan will deal with \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  issues in an appropriate and timely manner. \par \par \uc2  A European bank dealer in Tokyo said overseas speculators, Japanese trust banks and importers were keen to buy dollars on dips, giving firm support to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "There's a growing view that the dollar will keep rising amid disappointment that the government will not be able to come up with effective measures to boost the economy and the stock market until things get worse," he added. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the dollar was likely to test this year's high of 127.47 yen, with options-related stop-loss buying expected to take place at several points up to 128.00 yen. \par \par \uc2  The dollar closed at 126.45/55 yen and 1.7165/75 marks in New York on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The senior MOF official also declined to comment on whether the BOJ had taken part in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , detected by dealers in the morning, by the Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell dollars for Indonesia rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Last week, BOJ sold dollars for rupiah twice in concert with Indonesia and Singapore. ---Tatsuo Ito 81-3-3432-1396 \par \par \uc2  email:tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtbd02lx2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
