\par\par \b \uc2  MOF declines to comment on dlr, rupiah  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 251 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 November 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Nov 13 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MOF) declined to comment on Thursday on whether the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  (BOJ) had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Singapore to sell dollars against the yen, a senior MOF official said. \par \par \uc2  The official also declined to comment on whether the BOJ had taken part in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  detected by dealers in the morning by the Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars in both the Jakarta and Singapore markets to guard the rupiah from falling below the 3,400 level in early trading on Thursday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the greenback briefly lost ground against the yen on Japanese news reports that the Japanese central appeared to have sold dollars for the yen in morning Singapore. \par \par \uc2  Asked whether the BOJ had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell the dollar against the yen this morning in Singapore, the official said: "We cannot comment on that issue (on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 )." \par \par \uc2  As of 0330 GMT, the dollar recovered to 125.60/70 yen after falling to as low as around 125.20 yen earlier on the dollar/yen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  reports. It closed at 126.45/55 yen in New York on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  `There were rumours the BOJ was in the market. That's what brought dollar/yen sharply lower. They are very worried about dollar/yen being around 128/130,` a European bank dealer in Singapore said. \par \par \uc2  - Tokyo Treasury Desk (813) 3432-8785 \par \par \uc2  email: tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtbd02lie\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
