\par\par \b \uc2  Dollar gains against yen capped in Singapore. \b0\par\par\uc2 236 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 September 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE, Sept 19 (Reuter) - The dollar rise against the Japanese yen in Singapore was reined in by stop-loss triggers in early afternoon trade on Friday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar hit a high of 122.55 yen in the morning but came off after some stop-losses were triggered," said a dealer with a European bank. \par \par \uc2  At 0110 GMT, the dollar was trading at 122.30/40 yen, underpinned by buying interest from a U.S. house. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said comments by Richard Medley, investment advisor to George Soros, that the dollar could rise to 130 yen by year end helped propel the dollar, but were quickly shrugged off. \par \par \uc2  "The market is reacting more to the BOJ's comments on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said another dealer. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's (BOJ) executive director Takashi Anzai told a seminar that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakening had limitations because of limited external reserves. \par \par \uc2  He said if \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  were to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the dollar against the yen, there would be no limit to the amount of yen it could sell for dollars because the necessary funds could be secured by issuing bills underwritten by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "When a weak \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  comes under attack, there is limited amount of external reserves," he added. \par \par \uc2  -- Angela Tan (65-8703083); Fax (65) 776-8112 \par \par \uc2  -- Email: singapore.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011001dt9j028zm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
